/ PATCH TO LDF-V5D FOR SOFTWARE TIMER		-JVZ-

/ THIS PATCH ALLOWS THE HESITATE COMMAND TO WORK WHEN
/ THERE IS NO HARDWARE CLOCK IN THE SYSTEM.  THE FTIM
/ FUNCTION (AND THE FQUE TIMERS) DO NOT WORK, HOWEVER.

/ LOCATION 10115 CONTAINS THE 'TIME CONSTANT'.  IT IS
/ SET TO -2000 FOR AN 8/E (2.6 MICROSECOND 'ISZ') BUT
/ CAN BE CHANGED WITH 'FPAL(-TC,3115)' IF NECESSARY.

	F